{"id":"bc32b934fdbc1cf5","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dep-forall-11.md","title":"Set semantics","display":"df-dependent-universal-set — Set semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dep-forall-11","aliases":["16-df-dep-forall-11","Set semantics of dependent universal quantifier"],"display":"df-dependent-universal-set — Set semantics","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-type]]"],"source":"Definition 9.3.5 pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); §11.2 pp.654–655 (PDF674–675), powerset instance","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dep-forall-11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dep-forall-11</span><span>Set semantics of dependent universal quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-universal-set — Set semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.3.5 pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); §11.2 pp.654–655 (PDF674–675), powerset instance"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,U,\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,U,\\sigma\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。总空间、投影、逆像与右伴随由下节构造。</li>\n<li>两个幂集均取包含序，故函子及伴随在此表示偏序映射及其序伴随。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\forall x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,x)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)\\subseteq P&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P),\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*&amp;\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\forall x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,x)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)\\subseteq P&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P),\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*&amp;\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逆像中的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma,x)\">\\((\\gamma,x)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 的整个纤维都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。空纤维使全称条件为真，符合右伴随。这里是幂集模型，不使用未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 或类型范畴的任意序。来源：Definition 9.3.5 pp.540–541（PDF560–561）、§11.2 pp.654–655（PDF674–675）的集合实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,U,\\sigma$ 及 $\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-type]]；$P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma$，$Q\\subseteq\\Gamma$。总空间、投影、逆像与右伴随由下节构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,U,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.\\sigma&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,x)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.\\sigma\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P)&\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\forall x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,x)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*(Q)\\subseteq P&\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}(P),\\\\\n\\pi_\\sigma^*&\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_\\sigma}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(\\gamma,x)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-forall-11|df-dependent-universal-set — Set semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["093bd17785f1dbfc"]}